<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): grace notes of every kind. Bar 1: a slashed grace before an RH chord on beat 1 (nothing sounds before it). Bar 2: an unslashed grace before an LH chord on beat 3. Bar 3: two slashed graces (a turn) before a note that follows a tied note. Bar 4 (first ending): a grace before the first note after the repeat. Bar 5 (second ending): a grace chord. Written order: 1 2 3 4 | 1 2 3 5. -->
